        <mxCell id="r0" value="1. PRODUCT type = MOONCAKE / GIFT_SET / EMPTY_BOX. A PRESET gift box is an already-packed, stocked sellable SKU." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="1083" width="2880" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r1" value="2. PRESET checkout reduces only GIFT_SET finished stock. CUSTOM checkout reduces its EMPTY_BOX + selected MOONCAKE component stock." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="1122" width="2880" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r2" value="3. BOX is the model/capacity of an EMPTY_BOX SKU; each completed configuration must contain exactly the box capacity in cakes." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="1161" width="2880" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r3" value="4. A READY/stocked PRESET recipe is immutable. Changed contents require a new GIFT_SET SKU + PRESET configuration; PACK remains an atomic admin stock conversion." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
