        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r0" value="1. No admin approval: a successful COD checkout creates a PLACED order immediately. ORDER_ITEM uses exactly one SKU or CUSTOM config." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="1308" width="2880" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r1" value="2. PRESET ORDER_ITEM_COMPONENT rows describe contents for history only; CUSTOM component rows identify exactly which SKUs stock was deducted from." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="1347" width="2880" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r2" value="3. Saleable stock is subtracted ONCE at checkout. Cancel before SHIPPING to restore ONCE; no extra subtraction on dispatch/delivery." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="1386" width="2880" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r3" value="4. COD is initially UNPAID. Mark PAYMENT as PAID only when delivery and cash collection are confirmed; no bank-transfer steps in MVP." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#3d3d3d;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="1425" width="2880" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
